Key Features of This Improved Plugin:
Responsive Grid Layout - Uses CSS Grid for better performance and responsiveness

Mobile-First Design - Fully responsive with breakpoints for all device sizes

Customizable Shortcode - Use with attributes:

text
[most_viewed_products_grid title="Popular Designs" columns="4" count="8" category="embroidery"]
View Counter - Shows how many times each design has been viewed

Sale Badges - Highlights products on sale

Hover Effects - Subtle animations for better user experience

Category Filtering - Show most viewed from specific categories

Clean Design - Matches your embroidery shop aesthetic

Installation:
Create a folder /wp-content/plugins/most-viewed-products-grid/

Add the PHP code as most-viewed-products-grid.php

Create a css subfolder and add the CSS file

Activate the plugin in WordPress

Use the shortcode anywhere on your site

This version removes the dependency on Slick Slider and uses pure CSS for better performance, while maintaining all the functionality of tracking and displaying your most viewed embroidery designs.